Self-service group management is now available to Azure Active Directory Premium subscribers.  Your employees can add and manage cloud based security groups, and these groups can be used to assign access to applications.  Learn more on the <a href="https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?LinkID=394251&amp;clcid=0x409" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Active Directory team blog</a>.

